    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "已打开详情页原文：Detail for Portfolios Formed on Earnings/Price Detail for Portfolios Formed Monthly on Variance(Residuals) Monthly Returns: July 1963 - July 2026 Annual Returns: 1964 - 2025 Portfolios: Variance of daily returns (Var) quintiles; deciles. Construction: The portfolios are formed monthly on the variance of the residuals from the FF three-factor model (RVar) using NYSE breakpoints. RVar is estimated using 60 days (minimum 20) of lagged returns. Stocks: The portfolios for month t (formed at the end of month t-1), include NYSE, AMEX, and NASDAQ stocks with ME for the end of month t-1 and non-missing variance of daily returns."
